    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing these wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires written permission. LIMITATIONS: The generic humbucker maps the PDF's red/black pair to parallel coil starts and green/white to finishes; bare is the shield. The PDF's bridge ground ends at the volume casing; no bridge terminal exists in this model. The 0.05 cap uses the model's 47 nF setting. Pots use logical lugs and a linear scale, not physical orientation or audio taper."
